{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224250","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322425001:1":{"text":"僕の領地に足を踏み入れたからには、命令に従ってもらうぞ！","source_cn":"你们踏入了我的领地，就要听从我的指挥！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D50042E1E497C9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322425002:1":{"text":"領地？","source_cn":"领地？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x653454D98E502315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322425003:1":{"text":"シーッ！ロンロンに任せろ！","source_cn":"嘘、嘘！看满满的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15A9CA2427A006DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322425004:1":{"text":"ゴホンッ……殿下、たまたま貴殿の領地を通りかかったので、ご挨拶に参りました。","source_cn":"咳咳……殿下，我们经由您的领地，怎可不来打声招呼，献上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A0559A38D25822C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322425005:1":{"text":"ハハハ！くるしゅうない！くるしゅうない！","source_cn":"哈！说得好！说得好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9C9817EDAF3AA32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322425006:1":{"text":"最近、貴殿の領地で